urns, never their sum.","Decisions use close t and only 4H candles closed by t; entries and signal exits use open t+1. Fee 10 bps plus adverse slippage 5 bps on each side. One unlevered position, all available cash, fractional quantities; exchange lot/tick rounding and capacity are not modeled.","Known opening stop/target events resolve before later intrabar extremes. Otherwise stop-first for ambiguous OHLC; gap-through stops use the worse open, while favorable target gaps fill at the fixed target. No target fill on an entry bar. Stops remain active. Maximum hold 72 hours; predeclared fold boundaries flatten at the final bar open with both exit costs.","Drawdown uses hourly equity including estimated liquidation costs, not an intrabar worst-case path. No fees for idle cash, funding, shorting, leverage, tax or liquidity impact beyond fixed slippage.","Degradation and low-sample flags are descriptive; these short, single-symbol folds do not prove robustness, eliminate overfitting, or estimate a probability of future profit.","EMA 21/50 + RSI momentum, fold 1: training 2026-09-19T20:00:00.000Z to 2026-10-06T11:59:59.999Z, 23 trades, -5.429%; test 2026-10-06T12:00:00.000Z to 2026-10-12T00:59:59.999Z, 4 trades, -1.231% net.","EMA 21/50 + RSI momentum, fold 2: training 2026-09-19T20:00:00.000Z to 2026-10-12T00:59:59.999Z, 26 trades, -6.220%; test 2026-10-12T01:00:00.000Z to 2026-10-17T13:59:59.999Z, 5 trades, -3.651% net.","EMA 21/50 + RSI momentum, fold 3: training 2026-09-19T20:00:00.000Z to 2026-10-17T13:59:59.999Z, 30 trades, -9.486%; test 2026-10-17T14:00:00.000Z to 2026-10-23T03:59:59.999Z, 6 trades, -2.417% net.","EMA 21/50 + RSI momentum: low sample (15 out-of-sample trades; warning threshold 30).","EMA 50 + RSI pullback, fold 1: training 2026-09-19T20:00:00.000Z to 2026-10-06T11:59:59.999Z, 3 trades, -0.841%; test 2026-10-06T12:00:00.000Z to 2026-10-12T00:59:59.999Z, 0 trades, 0.000% net.","EMA 50 + RSI pullback, fold 2: training 2026-09-19T20:00:00.000Z to 2026-